<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-10-25T19:49:24.318Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:49:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Aung San Suu Kyi spoke with her son for the first time in over five years, and he said she sounded fairly healthy, while military commander Min Aung Hlaing met Japan envoy Sasakawa, showing diplomatic engagement despite ongoing fighting. Military bombing in Sittwe left streets silent after dusk and caused air ticket prices to rise three to four times as many people fled to Yangon, while columns of troops moved around Pulin village and displaced civilians from 70 villages across three townships. A blast in the Rakhine state capital killed at least two people, and a bus crash in Mandalay region killed six and injured twelve. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPMEoyNTRacGFNellGb0JqTUVRYXNWbWxoZkczZmFuLU1FczhkZEFsYUV6Nk1Iay1Jc2xDc0F0aDFGUEhEZHBHdlFka0p3czBFb0dRSEF4UjRkUnliVERuNkNiVkRmZHhrMnA5US01a3BaZ0o1TG1PMXJWZjNRb1A0bklWNVNvTURROWtYQjl1XzYzMjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQazlnbmRtMzdIN0gtdnVMZ0g5QlIxTFJZMU9zMk50UlV3QVp2eVFBLWJUUGhIQnQ1T21CWEZVV2dyN09BOF8yREt3RThUTjZzV0xObEtaMDJVZXNmV0ZRTGlKRmk4SldyNnNLaTAtS3VmY3c4TGhEcUQxVEZ5bGxPMmFDZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNaDQ3bFMyVWV0aHB5RXdQMVpuOWVMZzVWS3BBZTRHU196Wk95SHQwMTBrRkhoVzgzT2RlNUJWVnVPYWgwNm5MZy1adE1aQ3ZCSHJXb1BpcHVBOXhRZVVJWUpJYzBLOEc3clctNVo5MFpBUld4amFobWVISGhvaGthZE1SVndDOXl6aDlJaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02